  chunk C=  64:    1.9 ms   ->   52.8x faster
  chunk C= 256:    0.6 ms   ->  157.6x faster
PASS  chunking really is faster on GPU   | 157.6x at C=256
PASS  and the speed-up grows with the chunk size   | 6.6x (C=16) -> 157.6x (C=256)
this is the mechanism behind 'CMS is efficient': fewer, bigger GPU ops per token
